# AI gesnapt

Free AI-literacy materials for teachers and students (vo/mbo), website: [aigesnapt.nl](https://aigesnapt.nl)

## Contents
- `posters/` – AI-literacy posters (A3, PDF)
- `kraakkit/` – "AI Ontcijferd" kraakkit, printable version for the school printer
- `lessen/` – lesson slides (pptx)

